    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills out in Career Mode and race for the championship against your rivals.\u00a0 Race on seven different go-kart tracks and earn your spot at the top of the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an all-new career mode,\u00a0 pay entry fees,\u00a0 sell merchandise,\u00a0 buy kart upgrades and improve your race team over the course of the season.\u00a0 Can you win the Go-Kart Racing Championship?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-Season Career Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Trials (Steam Leaderboard Integration)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Go-Kart Livery Editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aerodynamic Drafting / Slipstream System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved AI Driver Knowledge and Racing Tactics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>QUICK RACES</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize the length of your own races on seven different fictional racetracks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Compete in quick races to practice and improve your speed. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMPETITIVE AI RACING</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Driver Knowledge and Tactics have been reimagined and improved with overtaking abilities and defensive driving.\u00a0 AI Drivers will also have personal &quot;attributes&quot; and can cause crashes with other drivers if they are aggressive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the career, AI Drivers will upgrade the cars and vary in speed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> A gamepad or controller is RECOMMENDED for the greatest driving experience. </strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills out in Career Mode and race for the championship against your rivals.\u00a0 Race on seven different go-kart tracks and earn your spot at the top of the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an all-new career mode,\u00a0 pay entry fees,\u00a0 sell merchandise,\u00a0 buy kart upgrades and improve your race team over the course of the season.\u00a0 Can you win the Go-Kart Racing Championship?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-Season Career Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Trials (Steam Leaderboard Integration)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Go-Kart Livery Editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aerodynamic Drafting / Slipstream System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved AI Driver Knowledge and Racing Tactics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>QUICK RACES</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize the length of your own races on seven different fictional racetracks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Compete in quick races to practice and improve your speed. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMPETITIVE AI RACING</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Driver Knowledge and Tactics have been reimagined and improved with overtaking abilities and defensive driving.\u00a0 AI Drivers will also have personal &quot;attributes&quot; and can cause crashes with other drivers if they are aggressive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the career, AI Drivers will upgrade the cars and vary in speed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> A gamepad or controller is RECOMMENDED for the greatest driving experience. </strong></p>",
